  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Police cooperation Colombia 2024-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polissamarbete med Colombia 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Project is Strengthening the Colombian Police to become a more transparent, responsive and civilian-oriented police organisation. The Authority Cooperation shall contribute to ensuring a safer and more open and transparent society for citizens in Colombia, with a high level of trust in the Colombian police.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xE4;r ett projektst&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r kapacitetsutveckling av den colombianska polisen, via teknisk assistans fr&#xE5;n den svenska polismyndigheten. Projektet syftar till att bidra till att st&#xE4;rka den colombianska polisen till att bli en mer transparent, lyh&#xF6;rd och civilt orienterad polisorganisation. Bidraget &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning p&#xE5; samarbetet mellan polismyndigheterna som startade 2013. Tidigare bidrags ID-nummer &#xE4;r: 52060048, 11444 och 16542.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a project support for capacity development of the Colombian Police, via technical assistance provided by the Swedish Police Authority. The project aims to contribute to strengthening the Colombian Police to become a more transparent, responsive, and civilian-oriented police organisation. The contribution is a continuation of the cooperation between the police authorities which started in 2013. Previous contribution ID-numbers are: 52060048, 11444 and 16542.</narrative>
  </description>
